      "body": "`experimental/sgl-router` renders, tokenizes and parses chats on the engine's behalf, then serves them through `/generate`. To match the engine exactly, it needs the engine's OpenAI-layer configuration. Server args are visible in `/server_info`, but several env vars the OpenAI layer reads are not:\r\n- `SGLANG_DEFAULT_THINKING`, `SGLANG_DSV4_REASONING_EFFORT` and `SGLANG_DSV41_REASONING_EFFORT` change the rendered prompt;\r\n- `SGLANG_FORWARD_UNKNOWN_TOOLS` and `SGLANG_TOOL_STRICT_LEVEL` change tool parsing and constraints.\r\n\r\nToday the router reads these from its own environment, so a router and engine configured differently produce different prompts, with no way to detect it. This PR makes the engine's values visible; a follow-up router PR adopts them and warns when the router's own configuration differs.\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\n- `build_server_info` (shared by HTTP `/server_info` and the native gRPC metadata) adds an `openai_env` block. It holds each env var listed in `OPENAI_LAYER_ENVS`, resolved through `envs`, so defaults are filled in:\r\n\r\n  ```json\r\n  \"openai_env\": {\r\n    \"SGLANG_DEFAULT_THINKING\": false,\r\n    \"SGLANG_DSV4_REASONING_EFFORT\": \"\",\r\n    \"SGLANG_DSV41_REASONING_EFFORT\": null,\r\n    \"SGLANG_INKLING_DEFAULT_REASONING_EFFORT\": null,\r\n    \"SGLANG_FORWARD_UNKNOWN_TOOLS\": false,\r\n    \"SGLANG_TOOL_STRICT_LEVEL\": 0,\r\n    \"SGLANG_ENABLE_REQUEST_HEADER_OVERRIDES\": false\r\n  }\r\n  ```\r\n\r\n- `TestServerInfoOpenAiEnvField`:\r\n  - checks the block reports overridden values;\r\n  - scans `entrypoints/openai`, `function_call` and `parser` for `envs.SGLANG_*` reads, and fails if one is missing from `OPENAI_LAYER_ENVS`. A new env var in the OpenAI layer therefore can't silently go unreported.\r\n\r\n## Checks\r\n\r\n- `test/registered/unit/entrypoints/test_server_info.py`: 33 passed, including the HTTP and gRPC transport parity test.\r\n- `ruff format` reports nothing to change on the touched files.\r\n\r\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #37892192183](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37892192183)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37892191980](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37892191980)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #37892192140](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37892192140)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
